
cff-version: 1.2.0

message: >-
  If you use RetroAtlas in your research,
  please cite this software and specify
  the version or Git commit used.

type: software

title: >-
  RetroAtlas: A pipeline for detection,
  reconstruction, and characterization
  of retrotransposition events from
  long-read sequencing data

