repository-code: https://github.com/Francisco100Iniesta/RetroAtlas-Pipeline

abstract: >-
  RetroAtlas is a Snakemake-based bioinformatics pipeline
  for the detection, reconstruction, characterization,
  and comparative analysis of retrotransposition events
  from long-read sequencing data. The workflow integrates
  multiple structural variant callers, sequence reconstruction,
  repeat annotation, genomic callability assessment,
  and targeted insertion evidence rescue.
